# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@host = https://localhost:7184

### Alle zalen
GET {{host}}/rooms

### Eén zaal
GET {{host}}/rooms/1

### Filteren
GET {{host}}/rooms?capacity=8

### Fout: zaal bestaat niet
GET {{host}}/rooms/999



### Toevoegen
POST {{host}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Directiekamer",
  "capacity": 6,
  "floor": 3
}

### Ongeldige zaal toevoegen (validatie moet 400 geven)
POST {{host}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "capacity": -5,
  "floor": 100
}


### Bijwerken
PUT {{host}}/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nieuwe naam",
  "capacity": 10,
  "floor": 2
}

### Verwijderen-
DELETE {{host}}/rooms/3

#### Bookings van room 1
GET {{host}}/rooms/1/bookings
